{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c5e97f40cb7189f3","type":"group","x":-1700,"y":-700,"width":604,"height":774,"color":"3","label":"Conceptos previos, requerimientos para el flujo y Pruebas "},
		{"id":"798795f48945dd95","type":"text","text":">[!warning] importante como añadir en `Device` \n>el campo `network`\n\nSin `network` en `device`  no pasara el filtro para aparecer como candidato para un ***`plmn update`*** en la ventana de ***`plmn launch update`*** del ***`admin`***","x":-1580,"y":-644,"width":388,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"02e7aa4ad6877dfc","type":"text","text":"campos del `mensaje`\n\n```js\n{\n  \"id\": [\"23031300000001\", 4812, 23, 1, 5],\n  \"ty\": \"sync\",\n  \"ts\": 1774451808,\n  \"bid\": 1,\n  \"hw\": [\"123456789012345\", \"8934071111111111111\", \"214071234567890\", \"BC95-G\", \"V100R100C10B657SP2\"],\n  \"plmn\": [1, 3],\n  \"d\": [[10, 2, 0, 0], [11, 5, 1, 1]]\n}\n```","x":-919,"y":-480,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c5eaaa14987dff51","type":"text","text":">[!success] Flujo para recibir ***`PLMN`***\n\n***`Device` *** \nEnvía request plmn a ***`GET /:sn/plmn`*** a la  ***`CL` ***    para actualizar su red mediante ***`fichero binario`***","x":-915,"y":-60,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7bcf3b01637abcf0","type":"text","text":"***`Device` *** \nRecibe el fichero binario","x":-915,"y":148,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"665d1da08bc91cb5","type":"text","text":">[!success] Flujo para recibir ***`network`***\n\n***`Device` *** \nenvía mensaje `sync`   para actualizar su ***`network`***","x":-919,"y":-266,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"086dcd9124d9e889","type":"text","text":">[!important] campo plmn\n>El campo `plmn` es un **array de 2 números**: `[operator, [[tableRevision]]]`.","x":-506,"y":-480,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1ec65f5ca867ed7","type":"text","text":"***`micro cl-pert`***  recibe el mensaje","x":-506,"y":-266,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d3ca4b93cb4a4d65","type":"text","text":"***`micro translator`***\nSyncParser.parse() descompone el array:","x":-104,"y":-266,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d0eabaf11e4ae889","type":"text","text":"***`micro commands sync.perte`***\nrecibe el mensaje parseado\n","x":290,"y":-266,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e1fe38365bc80aea","type":"text","text":"***`micro CL`*** \nRecive peticion en `messageProcessor.process() → retiveAction = \"plmn\" -> processPlmn` y llama a la `API` en busca del `.bin` autenticandose con ***`token-privado`*** ","x":-502,"y":-60,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f99c5077f74c573c","type":"text","text":"***`API`***\nescucha en ***`/api/file/{id}/binary`*** Responde enviando el fichero `.bin`\ndescifrando ***`token-publico`*** ","x":-104,"y":-60,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ea48099f0b687a57","type":"text","text":">[!tip] Se crea un ***`outPutMessage`***\n\n***`outputMsgService.storeOutput()`*** guarda para reintentos","x":227,"y":-480,"width":308,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"7ee22de3e539a019","type":"text","text":"***`micro commands/plmn`***\nRecibe el mensaje \n→ Parsea la tabla texto en líneas\n→ Genera el binario con CRC16\n→ ***Envia el .bin a la API mediante `jwt` en: files/plmn/plmn_op{X}_r{Y}_{timestamp}.bin***\n\n→ Actualiza plmnlist en MongoDB: filePath + active=true","x":-160,"y":-964,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b0cb585f3e1dc77d","type":"text","text":"***`micro translator`*** \n***`handleOutputCommand()\n   → processCommand()`*** traduce el comando a formato device: y Publica en ***`cl.`***","x":-160,"y":-724,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e3622114dded8527","type":"text","text":"***`API /api/plmn-list/:id/binary`***\nRecibe el fichero y lo guarda en el entorno.","x":227,"y":-964,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"eacecb07b4b11a5b","type":"text","text":"***`micro coap`*** \n cl-perte-coap → recibe el mensaje\n   → Busca el device en MongoDB ✓\n   → Busca manufacturedDevice ✓\n   → Busca IP del device \n   → Intenta enviar CoAP POST al device","x":227,"y":-724,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c2b2d37b89b54ff1","type":"text","text":">[!important] `TableRevision`\n\n**listado de códigos MCC-MNC** (Mobile Country Code + Mobile Network Code) separados por saltos de línea. Mira el ejemplo comentado en el código:\n\n```\n20205    ← KPN (Países Bajos)\n20404    ← Vodafone NL\n21401    ← Vodafone España\n22210    ← Vodafone Italia\n26201    ← Telekom Alemania\n310410   ← AT&T (USA)\n...\n```\n\nSon los operadores de red donde la SIM del device tiene **permiso de roaming**. Cada operador de telecomunicaciones (en este caso Vodafone/GDSP) proporciona esta lista.\n\nCada vez que se genera un nuevo `.bin` con una tabla PLMN actualizada, lleva un `operator` y un `release` (la revisión).\n\nEntonces:\n\n- **`operator`** = identificador del operador (ej: `1` = Vodafone)\n- **`release`** (tableRevision) = versión de esa tabla (ej: `3` = tercera revisión)\n","x":-913,"y":-1204,"width":319,"height":160},
		{"id":"2ab52dca0520f3aa","type":"text","text":">[!success] Flujo para crear un ***`New PLMN`*** \n\n`Admin` crea un `new plmn`\n\n","x":-911,"y":-964,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"518ed8b899485947","type":"text","text":">[!success] Flujo para lanzar un ***`New PLMN`*** \n\n`Admin` lanza un `plmn launch update`","x":-911,"y":-724,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fcb4c26fb2c6c397","type":"text","text":"***`API`*** Recibe en ***`POST /api/plmn-list/:id/launch`*** y diferencia entre `newDevice oldDevice` para enviar el `cmd`","x":-535,"y":-724,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d5337abea677f7ca","type":"text","text":">[!tip] Se crea un ***`outPutMessage`***\n\n***`outputMsgService.storeOutput()`*** guarda para reintentos","x":-526,"y":-1204,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"9e80d56e4ef035ec","type":"text","text":"***`API`*** recibe en `POST /api/plmn-list` y manda mensaje en RabbitMQ → topic: `command.plmn`","x":-526,"y":-964,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3d975cc528648e64","type":"text","text":">[!tip] Se crea un ***`outPutMessage`***\n\n***`outputMsgService.storeOutput()`*** guarda para reintentos","x":-185,"y":-1204,"width":317,"height":160,"color":"4"}
	],
